{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1195987-space-arcanum-only-or-combined","id":1195987,"title":"Space Arcanum only or combined?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-16T00:18:22-07:00","id":1195987,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Space Arcanum only or combined?","content":"Hello everyone,<br /> <br /> I have a question about Scrying that applies to most of the Space spells I guess.<br /> <br /> Can a mage in the Fallen World with the Space Arcanum affect something in the Underworld or The Shadow?<br /> <br /> For some reasons that I don't understand, you need Death 5 to enter the Underworld, and only Spirit 3 to enter the Shadowlands.<br /> But does it mean that you need Space 2 + Death 5 to cast Scrying on a subject that is currently in the Underworld, when the Mage is in the Fallen World?<br /> Same question with teleportation or any use of a spell at distance with the Space 2 Attainment.<br /> <br /> Finally what about the Astral Realms. Can you even follow with Scrying a subject in an Astral Realm whereas his body remain in the Fallen World?<br /> Can you even reach the Astral Realms with the Space Arcanum since it's not material?<br /> <br /> Thank you in advance for your time and answers.<br /> This is the biggest mystery of Mage: The Awakening for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24003,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24003-wrafaeil","user":"wrafaeil","date":". 03-16-2018, 03:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24003-wrafaeil","name":"wrafaeil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24003_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T02:01:24-07:00","id":1195996,"title":"","content":"First off, both Shadow and the Underworld are part of the Fallen World.<br /> <br /> Second, the difference between them for access is that Shadow has a barrier-membrane (the Gauntlet) covering the whole material planet on this side and most of the Shadow on the other, which is soft enough that tears naturally form in it at times, and you only need Spirit 3 to cross.<br /> <br /> The Underworld doesn't have such a membrane; it's completely walled off from the material world except for the irises between the two. Those Irises (&quot;Avernian Gates&quot;) are actually kinda common; every graveyard has one, as well as most other places associated with death. In the vicinity of one, you only need Death 3 to cast spells into the Underworld.<br /> <br /> The Death 5 requirement is to make a brand-new Avernian gate wherever you like","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T02:09:04-07:00","id":1195997,"title":"","content":"Don\u2019t have the book with me, but IIRC...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wrafaeil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1195987-space-arcanum-only-or-combined#post1195987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can a mage in the Fallen World with the Space Arcanum affect something in the Underworld or The Shadow?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. But things like sensory and sympathetic range still apply. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> For some reasons that I don't understand, you need Death 5 to enter the Underworld, and only Spirit 3 to enter the Shadowlands. </div> </div> </div>No, Death 5 (Making) is for creating gateways to the Underworld out of nothing. Existing gateways can be opened by Death 3 (Weaving). <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But does it mean that you need Space 2 + Death 5 to cast Scrying on a subject that is currently in the Underworld, when the Mage is in the Fallen World?<br /> Same question with teleportation or any use of a spell at distance with the Space 2 Attainment. </div> </div> </div>Can you perceive a target in those otherworlds with your senses? If yes, then they\u2019re at sensory or remote range, so no need for Death/Spirit. (Death/Spirit can help perceive the otherworlds, though. But no need to add it to the spells themselves)<br /> <br /> Most of the time they won\u2019t be perceivable, and thus you need Sympathetic Range. Which doesn\u2019t require Death/Spirit. <br /> <br /> (Oh, and the Shadow and the Underworld are still part of the Fallen World. Just saying.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Finally what about the Astral Realms. Can you even follow with Scrying a subject in an Astral Realm whereas his body remain in the Fallen World? </div> </div> </div>I see no reason why not. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you even reach the Astral Realms with the Space Arcanum since it's not material? </div> </div> </div>I think this is a No, but not sure.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: Aaand the developer himself said it first. Yay.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T02:21:25-07:00","id":1195998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1195987-space-arcanum-only-or-combined?p=1195996#post1195996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the vicinity of one, you only need Death 3 to cast spells into the Underworld.</div> </div> </div> </div>So you can't cast spells into the Underworld otherwise, even sympathetically? It makes sense (or otherwise the Gauntlet would just end up penalizing spells when more distant realms don't have a penalty) but I wish it was written in the book. Unless I've missed a passage, but I don't think I have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T03:23:34-07:00","id":1196428,"title":"","content":"Hello, thank you for your answers, it all makes sense, and Space has not as many limits as I thought.<br /> <br /> So basically you can use Space 2 to access anything in the Fallen World (which includes Shadow and Underworld)<br /> So Death Arcanum is not the only way to reach the Underworld. If you have Space 2, it's a bypass to reach anywhere in any Realm.<br /> <br /> And scrying for your lover in the Underworld is not more complicated than scrying for your lover on a business trip in Toronto.<br /> <br /> Correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24003-wrafaeil","name":"wrafaeil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24003_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}